      "writtenOn": "2026-10-07T05:39:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, I wanted to get a sense of how much we can gain with strict mode; so far, with the 4 patch series + Aashish\u0027s port I\u0027m seeing signficant improvements in strict mode.\n```\nWorkload\tnested\tstack\tΔ\nrr4k_qd32\t224.8K\t270.2K\t+20.2%\nrr4k_4j\t        352.5K\t519.6K\t+47.4%\nrw4k_qd32\t221.8K\t265.7K\t+19.8%\nrw4k_4j\t        350.4K\t580.5K\t+65.7%\nmix4k_4j\t342.0K\t464.4K\t+35.8%\n```\n\n(I\u0027ll to port these over to 7.3 to see if we can replicate the same gains.",
